  "plan": "ADR 0039; named collector RPC entrypoints before alarm consumer; unchanged acquisition contract",
  "maintenance": "Hand-maintained. tasks/_lib/deploy-order.test.ts keeps it in step with infra/workers-ci.json and with the deploy steps of .github/workflows/_deploy-workers.yml: one step per deploy entry, in this order, each with id deploy-<name> so the release record can report per Worker.",
  "health": "healthPath is the route the release postcheck requests over the workers.dev hostname, or \"\" when the Worker is checked another way (the Processor answers through the App's service binding) or not at all. healthAuth says how CD authenticates it: \"access\" sends the Cloudflare Access service token of the production Environment, \"none\" is an unauthenticated route. healthIdentity is the field of the JSON answer the postcheck requires to be present and non-empty.",
